{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52826","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 康珽","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"解绶申知足，归元道益真。\n离章垂睿作，祖帐别羣臣。\n紫禁辞明主，青溪访羽人。\n赏延忠孝着，荣耀故乡春。\n（见宋孔延之《会稽掇英总集》卷二）（按：《会稽掇英总集》此诗作者作「康璡」。\n今检《御史台精舍题名》及《金石录》卷七录《唐康珽告》、《宝刻丛编》录《复斋碑录》收《大理少卿康公夫人河间郡君许氏墓志》诸石刻，皆作「康珽」，故从之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"康珽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52826.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52826","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}